% What lesson 16's four conjunctive queries should answer on a two-edge chain.
% A fact must be derived; `:- fact.` must never be, and may use variables.
%
%   python3 diagnose.py programs/minimise.dl --expect programs/minimise.expect
%   python3 mutation.py programs/minimise.dl --expect programs/minimise.expect

has_edge(a, b).
has_edge(b, c).
two_hop(a).                      % a -> b -> c
:- two_hop(b).                   % c goes nowhere
:- mutual(X).                    % a chain has no 2-cycle
:- triangle(X).                  % and no triangle
